@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@couchdb = http://127.0.0.1:5984

### Gateway liveness
GET {{gateway}}/api/health/live

### Gateway readiness (includes CouchDB)
GET {{gateway}}/api/health/ready

### Active schemas through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/schema-files

### Reports through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports

### CouchDB server identity (no credentials)
GET {{couchdb}}/

### This must remain unauthorized without credentials
GET {{couchdb}}/_all_dbs

# Keep secrets in .env. Do not add Authorization headers or passwords here.
